DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ttppmm driver provides support for various trusted platform modules
     (TPM) that can store cryptographic keys.

     Supported modules:

           ••   Atmel 97SC3203
           ••   Broadcom BCM0102
           ••   Infineon IFX SLD 9630 TT 1.1 and IFX SLB 9635 TT 1.2
           ••   Intel INTC0102
           ••   Sinosun SNS SSX35
           ••   STM ST19WP18
           ••   Winbond WEC WPCT200

     The driver can be configured to use an IRQ by providing a free ISA inter‐
     rupt vector in _/_b_o_o_t_/_d_e_v_i_c_e_._h_i_n_t_s.

